Subject: [PATCH 107/108] =?UTF-8?q?fix:=20student=20de-noise=20=E2=80=94?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20boot=20to=20chat,=20hide=20Today=20+=20Connections,=20sessio?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ns-only=20sidebar,=20per-answer=20Sources,=20settings=20scroll?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Today hidden from student nav (STUDENT_HIDDEN_NAV) and every boot/fallback
  route lands in chat (cold start, 'new'/'*' routes, welcome finish).
- Connections dropped from STUDENT_SETTINGS_KEEP; onboarding teaches the chat
  flow (ConnectStep rows) instead of embedding the settings page.
- Project surfaces off in student build: stale persisted grouped-flag can no
  longer flip '+' to project-create; blank state offers 'New session';
  ProjectDialog unmounted.
- Sources rail scopes to the current exchange (last user message onward) —
  kills session-long pile-up and stale rail after session switches.
- Settings overlay: OverlayMain overflow-y-auto so every page scrolls.
- recorder: fix invalid JSX comment placement from 049fa146d (TS1005).
- .js shadows regenerated (incl. stale activity-phrase.js).
